        "density": 0.14017,
        "chars": 193,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 13.84
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        117,
        833,
        1545,
        945
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, on June 14, 2022, the federal court in *Nunez* approved the *Nunez* Action Plan, which \"represents a way to move forward with concrete measures now to address the ongoing crisis at Rikers Island\"; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2289,
          "min": -1.3828
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 59,
          "mean": -0.0085,
          "min": -0.3235
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 13956,
        "area_px": 141008,
        "density": 0.09897,
        "chars": 209,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.98
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        117,
        983,
        1545,
        1176
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, although there has been improvement in excessive staff absenteeism, extraordinarily high rates of attrition due to staff retirements and other departures continue to seriously affect the Department of Correction's (DOC's) staffing levels and create a serious risk to DOC's ability to carry out the safety and security measures required for the maintenance of sanitary conditions; and access to basic services, including showers, meals, visitation, religious services, commissary, and recreation; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1985,
          "min": -1.1973
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 94,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0052
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 34975,
        "area_px": 242987,
        "density": 0.14394,
        "chars": 508,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.52
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        117,
        1210,
        1545,
        1288
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, this Order is given to prioritize compliance with the *Nunez* Action Plan and to address the effects of DOC's staffing levels, the conditions at DOC facilities, and health operations; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1583,
          "min": -1.0329
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 41,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0098
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 13966,
        "area_px": 98202,
        "density": 0.14222,
        "chars": 196,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.03
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        117,
        1320,
        1545,
        1435
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, additional reasons for requiring the measures continued in this Order are set forth in Emergency Executive Order No. 140 of 2022, Emergency Executive Order No. 579 of 2024, and Emergency Executive Order 623 of 2024; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1398,
          "min": -1.2563
        },
        "category": {
