    {
      "bbox": [
        117,
        1470,
        1545,
        1549
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the state of emergency existing within DOC facilities, first declared in Emergency Executive Order No. 241, dated September 15, 2021, and extended by subsequent orders, remains in effect;",
